	},
	{
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=1, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=2, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=3, time=1500},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat040040"},
		line=1093,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"As Himi-no-Mikoto assumes her seat of honor, all her court lowers their heads in a respectful bow.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"Seated among her court are the heads of the thirty-six noble houses that carry out her will, assisting her in administering the Empire.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"They are the former chieftains of the realms that joined the confederacy led by Hi no Kuni during the Great War against Ko no Kuni.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"Tooru is naturally among their ranks.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"Standing at Himi-no-Mikoto's right hand, I carefully survey the hall should the unthinkable ever happen.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“That is enough. Arise and hearken unto me.”",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"At Himi-no-Mikoto's command, the heads finally rise up, silently looking upon her with straight backs.",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"Today is the monthly Grand Council where all the heads of the noble houses are convened.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"A tense atmosphere fills the room.",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I would first speak regarding the Great Temple at Iseya.”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Through your dedicated efforts, the construction was recently completed without incident. You have my most sincere gratitude.”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Iseya is the site of my birth.”",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“There is much significance to the raising of a grand temple there, one capable of serving as the locus of our faith.”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“With the completion of the Imperial Chronicles last year, and now this, we have laid a firm foundation for the preservation of our Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			{
"The Imperial Chronicles are a history of the Empire, compiled on the decree of Himi-no-Mikoto.",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			{
"Starting from Oomikami's creation of the land, it records the history of how His daughter, Himi-no-Mikoto, united the realm and founded the Empire.",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
{"font", size=47},
"I can't imagine Himi-no-Mikoto was actually the child of Oomikami, and it greatly dramatizes the events of the Empire's founding, but in time, the accounts of the Imperial Chronicles will become gospel.",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[18]={
			{
"As I understand it, the thirty-six houses each compiled their own histories in similar chronicles as well.",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"But it would not do for a united Empire to have thirty-six founding documents that offer differing interpretations of its origin.",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			{
"Thus, Himi-no-Mikoto commissioned the Imperial Chronicles to present a unified account of the Empire's nascent history.",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			{
"Following that, she erected the largest temple yet known to man at Iseya, the place of her birth, that the people might know of Oomikami's greatness.",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			{
"In doing so, the people would be further compelled to venerate Oomikami, and in turn, increase their devotion to His daughter, Himi-no-Mikoto.",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			{
"A mere tool such as I does not pretend to comprehend it, but it would seem as though the machinations of power and authority amongst men are complicated indeed.",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Chancellor of the Realm"},
			{
"“The completion of the Great Temple is truly a joyous occasion worthy of celebration.”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Chancellor of the Realm"},
			{
"“However, some of our noble houses are hindered in our promulgation of the Imperial Chronicles.”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			{
"The Chancellor of the Realm speaks on behalf of the house heads.",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“How so?”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Chancellor of the Realm"},
			{
"“There are insufficient learned scholars capable of reading the Imperial Chronicles aloud to the people.”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Chancellor of the Realm"},
			{
"“What magnificent Chronicles they are, yet without those who might spread the gospel...”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I'm well aware of it.”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Though you are also surely aware that I have commissioned a center of learning to be constructed in Iseya, correct?”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I intend to cultivate a new generation of ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"orthodox",
{"/font"},
" priests and priestesses and appoint them to positions throughout the realm.”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Among their duties will be to promulgate the truth of the Imperial Chronicles.”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"There are currently many sects of priests and priestesses.",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			{
"Each lineage of priests has its own teachings and doctrines.",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto seeks to unify them under one common orthodoxy.",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Chancellor of the Realm"},
			{
"“Your keen insight humbles us all.”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			{
"The house heads prostrate themselves as one.",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Chancellor of the Realm"},
			{
"“If I might speak of an unrelated matter, there are troubling reports of disloyal subjects amassing arms to the north.”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I am aware.”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Maki, rally your clan and pacify them.”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"Do",
{"/font"},
" endeavor to exhaust all peaceful means of recourse before you exterminate them.”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Sarashina, you are to oversee the expedition and report directly to me.”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			{
"The heads of House Maki and House Sarashina lower their heads.",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			{
"Both houses distinguished themselves in the field during the previous war.",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Has anyone else any counsel to seek?”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			{
"At each Grand Council, Himi-no-Mikoto ordains her will with a lucidity that brooks no dissent.",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			{
"The house heads are helpless but to prostrate themselves before her.",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			{
{"font", size=53},
"Though Himi-no-Mikoto was recognized as sovereign for her peerless beauty and proficiency with magicks, it is perhaps her leadership abilities which distinguish her most of all.",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[50]={
			{
"Beside her role as a so-called statesman, Himi-no-Mikoto also serves as the Empire's supreme priestess.",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			{
"She fulfills a paramount role as master of ceremonies in the rituals that pray for good harvests and preserve the lands from famine and plague.",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			{
"As the exalted personage responsible for conveying their prayers to Oomikami, Himi-no-Mikoto carries all the expectations of the faithful populace upon her shoulders.",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Very well. I myself have one final matter to raise.”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“With the completion of the Great Temple, I have no further qualms regarding domestic governance.”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Henceforth, I wish for us to devote our efforts toward preparations against external threats.”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Chancellor of the Realm"},
			{
"“What external threats might you speak of?”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“It is said that barbarians yet abound beyond the sea.”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“We must make preparations against their inevitable invasion.”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Chancellor of the Realm"},
			{
"“Should any ruffians dare invade, we shall gladly meet them in the field ourselves!”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto merely purses her lips at this display of bluster from the house heads.",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Permit yourselves some greater consideration.”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“If the invaders arrive from beyond the sea, we cannot hope to acquire any new conquests even with their defeat.”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“How, then, do you intend to reward your loyal soldiers for their service?”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Chancellor of the Realm"},
			{
"“Mh... Indeed...”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Would it not be more prudent to forestall any such encroachments in the first place?”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“As such, I seek to extend a great Barrier of magicks across all the Empire's dominion.”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			{
"The hall is set astir by her proclamation.",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			{
"Even to raise a ward capable of enshielding Tenkyo alone would demand the sacrifice of at least twenty priestesses.",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			{
"How many priestesses would have to forfeit their lives in order to create this Barrier capable of protecting all the Empire?",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Chancellor of the Realm"},
			{
"“Is such an edifice truly within the realm of possibility?”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Indeed it is.”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“However, it would require no less than two hundred years to complete.”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“As such, I must implore those of you gathered here today to contribute the resources necessary to see this monumental project to fruition.”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Chancellor of the Realm"},
			{
"“Pray stay! Stay but a moment, Your Majesty!”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Chancellor of the Realm"},
			{
"“We have already been called upon to empty our private coffers for the construction of the Great Temple.”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Chancellor of the Realm"},
			{
"“If this is to continue for another two hundred years... no small measure of discontentment will surely be fomented.”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			{
"Even I find myself sympathizing with the chancellor's objections.",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"It must not be easy to accept having to pay for a project that only your great-grandchildren might see come to fruition.",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			{
"But Himi-no-Mikoto does not waver.",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Lord Chancellor, are the ravages wrought by Ko no Kuni already but a distant memory to you?”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Should our Empire ever fall, our people will be subjugated as slaves.”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“All those present, yourself included, will see your titles vanished, your fortunes plundered, your honor debased.”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Wish you for your descendants to know of such sorrow?”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Chancellor of the Realm"},
			{
"“Nay...”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Such a fate may yet be averted with the construction of the Barrier.”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
{"font", size=51},
"“I humbly ask your cooperation to build an Empire that may preserve for ages more, an Empire where our descendants two thousand years hence may live without fear of external threats.”",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[87]={
			{
"The heads of the noble houses prostrate themselves at\nHimi-no-Mikoto's earnest entreaty.",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Chancellor of the Realm"},
			{
"“...We hear and obey.”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			{
"The Grand Council is adjourned, and we make for our usual spot on the hillside.",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Haah... My shoulders are killing me.”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Even you're capable of getting nervous, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			{
"I never would have been able to tell otherwise.",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Just what do you think of me as?”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Every one of them is a great chieftain forged in the crucible of battle.”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“They submit to me now, but they will be swift to defect as soon as I provide them an opening.”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			{
"If not for her extraordinary beauty, Himi-no-Mikoto would be indistinguishable at a glance from an ordinary maiden of marriageable age.",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			{
"Yet all the chieftains recognize her for her erudite insight, her fairness in governance, and her proficiency with magicks.",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Hmph, yet all you have to do is attend me on the sidelines. Must be nice.”",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto flops down onto the grassy hillside with a sour expression.",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			{
"I lower myself down beside her.",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Incidentally, I believe that the Chancellor of the Realm─”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I'm well aware.”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“In all likelihood, he will someday raise the flag of rebellion against me.”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“It seems I needn't have even mentioned it.”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Hahaha! I see you've managed to glean some measure of appreciation for the human heart after all.”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Would that you might only extend that courtesy to ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"me,",
{"/font"},
" I'd have no further complaints.”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto stares into mine face with eyes full of provocation.",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“What do you mean?”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Hopeless as ever, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Haah... I should have made you more human.”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto heaves a helpless sigh to herself.",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“In that case, can we truly leave the chancellor to his own devices?”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“We will need to deal with him eventually.”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto murmurs, staring into the distance.",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Our Empire was only able to unite as one with the perilous threat of Ko no Kuni hanging above us.”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“But with this threat vanquished, the chieftains are beginning to remember the grand ambitions they'd sealed away in their hearts.”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Until recently, more than a few of the noble houses were sworn enemies of Hi no Kuni.”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I have no illusions that such deep resentments will be soon forgotten.”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“But were it not for you, their realms would have fallen before Ko no Kuni.”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“The strong merely do what they can.”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Hi no Kuni likewise subjugated our enemies, that we might preserve ourselves.”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“My hands are as stained as those of any other conqueror.”",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto unfurls her hands and stares intently at them.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Conflict and blight are of the same ilk.”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Even if all seems well on the surface, it proliferates as soon as you direct your attentions elsewhere.”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Most cruelly, conflict countenances no victors, and it is those who take the field that suffer the most.”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“So long as I yet draw breath, I vow to rid these lands of further strife.”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto clenches her hands firmly shut, her eyes burning with a fierce determination.",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“If you put an end to conflict, I should indeed become a complete good-for-nothing.”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Hahaha! I suppose it ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"would",
{"/font"},
" be inconsiderate of me to create you and then proceed to speak of an end to all strife.”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Mine existence is one that cuts down all calamity befalling the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Should there be no calamity, mine purpose is of no avail.”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“If ever the time does come, I shall call upon you without reservation.”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Do not betray my expectations, ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"Ame no",
{"/font"},
" ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"Mitsurugi.",
{"/font"},
"”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			{
"She calls me by a title that's been making the rounds as of late.",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			{
"According to the rumors, I am a divine blade bestowed upon Himi-no-Mikoto by Oomikami Himself─the Ame no Mitsurugi.",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			{
"There are whispers that any who plot rebellion against Himi-no-Mikoto will find themselves swiftly cut down by me, no matter where they might attempt to seek shelter.",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“That title doesn't sit well with me.”",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Hehee, is that so?”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“But enough of this. Let us keep affairs of politics confined to the Imperial Palace.”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I, for one, wish to speak of more delightful matters.”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto gestures at the peach trees blooming on the hillside.",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Behold, are these Persica blossoms not fair beyond measure?”",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Far paler than vermilion, yet ever more vibrant than ash─does their delightful hue not stir your heart to wonder?”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“...Not particularly, no.”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Why, the sight of these dainty petals dancing on the wind is as watching young nymphs at play.”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Could such a sight possibly not tug at your heartstrings?”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto's eyes resemble those of a young maiden as they sparkle with fascination.",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“I see that you truly do love flowers.”",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“And Persica most of all.”",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Do you find such a fascination with flowers unbecoming?”",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Not particularly, no.”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto heaves a grand sigh as I offer mine honest thoughts.",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“What a dullard you are...”",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I should have thought better than to expect any amusement from conversing with such a simpleton.”",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“What does 'simpleton' mean?”",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“It means a man the likes of you without a shred of wit about him!”",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“I apologize for being unable to offer a more considerate reply.”",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Only a true simpleton among simpletons would reply as such. I swear...”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto sulkily lowers her head.",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Mitsurugi, know you no pleasures beyond those of the blade?”",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			{
"I pause and consider, but nothing in particular comes to mind.",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			{
"Even drink is an indulgence I enjoy only in Tooru's company; it is not anything I would seek out alone.",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“What about women? Have you any interest in the fairer sex?”",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Unfortunately not.”",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Hmm... Then you would think nothing of it, even if I were to do this?”",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto reclines her body, resting her head on mine lap.",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Well? What say you?”",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Your hair is most soft.”",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Hehee, really now? Anything else?”",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“The last time I regarded you so closely was... during the Great War.”",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			{
"I always stood alone at the vanguard during our campaigns against Ko no Kuni.",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			{
{"font", size=53},
"The armies of the other chiefs, such as Maki, Sarashina, and Inou, followed closely behind and intercepted any enemies that slipped past who would threaten Himi-no-Mikoto.",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[174]={
			{
"However, just once, Himi-no-Mikoto was struck and wounded by a stray arrow.",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			{
"I raced to her side as soon as I sensed the harm that befell mine creator, only to find her shoulder stained with blood.",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			{
"I can still recall how I cast all her attendants aside and cradled her in mine arms.",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“You delivered me quite the shock.”",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I never expected to see you so disturbed for as long as I lived.”",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“When I realized myself a worthless blade incapable of protecting even mine own lord, I could not restrain myself.”",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			{
"That was the first and last time mine thoughts were led astray in the midst of battle.",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“...What fond memories.”",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			{
"Still resting her head on mine lap, Himi-no-Mikoto stares vacantly at the sky above.",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			{
"Eventually, her eyes flutter shut.",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			{
"Just when I think her asleep, a tranquil melody drifts forth from her efflorescent lips.",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			{
"This is a tune she hums often when we are alone on this hillside.",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			{
"It's a melody as lovely as the scattering peach petals, though always carrying with it a tinge of plaintive sorrow.",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			{
"Whenever I close mine eyes and yield myself to its embrace, mine mind and body feel strangely at ease.",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			{
"For a while, I permit myself to bask in the gentle spring sun, commending all mine soul to Himi-no-Mikoto's song.",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“That's a beautiful melody.”",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Hmm? Ahh...”",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I know not from whom I learned this tune, but I always find myself humming it during idle moments.”",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Perhaps it is a lullaby I once heard as a child.”",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“I believe it to be a fine lullaby indeed.”",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“I can think of nothing more fitting for mine creator to sing to me.”",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Ahaha! Seems I've found myself quite the oversized child to fuss over.”",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto laughs mirthfully as she playfully rolls her head across mine thighs.",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Whenever I can be with you like this, the vexations of daily life all but vanish.”",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“My body and soul remember the lightness of youth once more.”",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“I cannot imagine you having ever been a child.”",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“What a cruel thing to say! I am just as much a human as any other.”",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			{
"Her disgruntlement soon fades away, however, and she resumes humming her song.",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			{
"She seems to be in a good mood today.",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			{
"Mine soul drifting on the melody as the warm spring breeze, I gaze vacantly at the smoke of hearthfires trailing through the sky.",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			{
"Ah, what blissful peace.",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			{
"Would that days such as these could continue forevermore...",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“At first, I was but a humble priestess.”",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I learned magicks that I might defend the people, and I fought that I might safeguard these lands.”",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I merely happened to be blessed with a talent for magicks, yet before I knew it, I found myself the ruler of Hi no Kuni.”",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“And here again I find myself, the Empress of this realm.”",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Oomikami works in mysterious ways.”",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Even the greatest priestess in the Empire knows not what the future holds, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“If I did, these lands would never have known such strife.”",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“If I truly were the greatest priestess there ever was, so many innocents would never have lost their lives.”",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“But because I failed to forge common understanding and make treaty, this land was plunged into war.”",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Because I failed to make the necessary preparations, the people suffered and died.”",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Though I did all I could to serve them, my actions still inflicted grievous harm upon the people.”",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“And as a desperate last resort, I even willfully chose to sacrifice them to my end...”",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Their blood is on my hands.”",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto's eyes spill over with sorrow given physical form.",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			{
"This side of her, this humane and sensitive girl easily moved to tears, is one she would never show to any other but me.",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Mitsurugi... what do you think?”",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Am I walking a righteous path?”",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			{
"Wiping her tears, she looks up at me.",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“I believe you are.”",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Mitsurugi...!”",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“You are mine lord. I should never doubt any path mine lord chooses to walk.”",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Haah... what an exceedingly worthless answer.”",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Was there any other answer?”",
			},
		},
		[229]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“'Tis no matter. Your answer was worthless all the same.”",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Oh, I see now!”",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“If you submit unconditionally to my will, then how about this?”",
			},
		},
		[232]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto leaps to her feet.",
			},
		},
		[233]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Mitsurugi, heed my command.”",
			},
		},
		[234]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“You are to do all that is in your power to understand human emotions.”",
			},
		},
		[235]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Alright. Got it.”",
			},
		},
		[236]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“How frivolous. What an unimaginably frivolous response.”",
			},
		},
		[237]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Are you sure you even comprehend? I swear...”",
			},
		},
		[238]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto lays her head in mine lap once again.",
			},
		},
		[239]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Haah... How did you grow up to be like this?”",
			},
		},
		[240]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“You always seem to be enjoying yourself so much more whenever you are accompanying Inou or Chihaya.”",
			},
		},
		[241]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“I believe that yours is a special existence to me, Himi-no-Mikoto.”",
			},
		},
		[242]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto is the one and only person who may wield me.",
			},
		},
		[243]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Hmm? Special, you say...”",
			},
		},
		[244]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Then I should like for you to show me a side of yourself not known to any other.”",
			},
		},
		[245]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Such as?”",
			},
		},
		[246]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Well, well, it would appear that you have yet another matter to ponder over.”",
			},
		},
		[247]={
			{
"She lets out a giggle as she pokes me on the nose.",
			},
		},
		[248]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Haah... If only I could spend the rest of my days with you like this...”",
			},
		},
		[249]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Tomorrow is sure to be a miserable day.”",
			},
		},
		[250]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Is there some matter with tomorrow?”",
			},
		},
		[251]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Did you already forget? I have marriage interviews tomorrow.”",
			},
		},
		[252]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto is yet unmarried.",
			},
		},
		[253]={
			{
"However, opinions abound that she ought to soon birth an heir to the throne, that the Empire might long endure.",
			},
		},
		[254]={
			{
"To that end, days filled with marriage interviews are not an uncommon occurrence for her.",
			},
		},
		[255]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Is it not a wonderful thing that you can interview so many potential suitors?”",
			},
		},
		[256]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Go walk a thousand leagues standing on your head, then ask me that again,”",
			},
		},
		[257]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Ahhh... Oh Oomikami, what a pain...”",
			},
